Object.assign(TR.ht, {"Chosen": "Chwazi", "Your photo": "Foto ou", "Is this the right cover? Tap another one to switch.": "Èske se bon kouvèti a? Touche yon lòt pou chanje.", "📷 After scanning a book, its possible covers appear right away: tap the one that matches yours.": "📷 Apre w eskane yon liv, kouvèti posib li yo parèt touswit: touche sa ki sanble ak pa w la."});

Object.assign(TR.ht, {"💬 You’ve been testing My Bookshelf for a few days. Could you tell me what you think? On the app’s Google Play page, scroll down to “Private feedback” and write a sentence or two: what you like, what’s confusing, what you’d change. Only I can read it, and it’s what Google looks at before letting the app into the Play Store.": "💬 Sa fè kèk jou w ap teste My Bookshelf. Èske w ka di m sa w panse? Sou paj Google Play aplikasyon an, desann jiska “Kòmantè prive” epi ekri yon fraz oswa de: sa w renmen, sa ki pa klè, sa w ta chanje. Se mwen sèl ki li l, e se sa Google gade anvan l aksepte aplikasyon an nan Play Store.", "Open Google Play": "Louvri Google Play", "Later": "Pita", "Private feedback on Google Play": "Kòmantè prive sou Google Play"});
